program	errors/no_hidden_alloc_closure_pushed_into_a_vector.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	an escaping closure heap-allocates its captured environment — `--no-hidden-alloc` forbids allocations the source does not name
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: an escaping closure heap-allocates its captured environment — `--no-hidden-alloc` forbids allocations the source does not name"
log	"  --> examples/errors/no_hidden_alloc_closure_pushed_into_a_vector.saw:21:17"
log	"     |"
log	" 21 |     try! v.push({ base + 5 })"
log	"     |                 ^"
log	"   hint: pass the closure straight to the call that runs it (a non-escaping closure keeps its environment on the stack), drop the captures and take the values as parameters, or hold the shared state in an explicit `Box`/`Arc` so the allocation is written down"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
